OL,3,GNEWSA'My driving instructor videos were
OL,4,Areplicated by an AI deepfake account'  
OL,6,FA UK driving instructor who has 1.5m   
OL,7,Fsubscribers on YouTube has warned      
OL,8,Flearners about a fake artificial       
OL,9,Fintelligence account that she says     
OL,10,Freplicated her content online.         
OL,12,FWest London-based Aman Sanghera,       
OL,13,Ffounder of the Clearview Driving       
OL,14,Fchannel, says instructional videos were
OL,15,Fmanipulated to alter her face and voice
OL,16,Fwhile retaining original footage of her
OL,17,Fpupils and driving routes.             
OL,19,FThe incident highlights a growing trend
OL,20,Fof digital impersonation and content   
OL,21,Ftheft affecting online creators across 
OL,22,Fsocial media platforms.                
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
