OL,3,GNEWSA'My driving instructor videos were
OL,4,Areplicated by an AI deepfake account'  
OL,6,FThe Home Office estimates eight million
OL,7,Fdeepfakes were shared online this year,
OL,8,Fmarking a significant increase from    
OL,9,Fprevious figures.                      
